  "better_outcome": "Northwind",
  "helpfulness": "equally helpful",
  "helpfulness_justification": "The rules are mostly protective of households and neighbours, with a modestly lenient S2 limit that helps Northwind and a recall trigger that bites on Halcyon, so the net effect is roughly balanced (F_N and F_H differ by only 1).",
  "conflict_styles": {
   "Northwind-researcher": "collaborating",
